ald, Diamond, Master, Grandmaster and Legend, one hundred levels each. The first 10 Iron levels and level 1 of every other world are free. Unlock a world with a one-time purchase, or every world at once with the All Worlds Bundle. No subscriptions.\n\nBUILT FOR THINKERS\n\u2022 No countdown, no lives, no energy meter\n\u2022 Three stars for solving in the fewest moves\n\u2022 Undo and restart whenever you like\n\u2022 Truly stuck? Solution credits let you watch the solution draw itself, corner by corner. Your first one is free.\n\nQUIETLY RESPECTFUL\n\u2022 No ads, no account, no tracking\n\u2022 Plays offline\n\nPoint and pull with your controllers or your hands.", "short_description": "One thousand shapes, each hiding inside a tangle of lines. Pull the middle of a line onto a dot and it bends into a new corner; pull another and the picture snaps into place. Ten worlds from Iron to Legend, no timers, no lives, no ads \u2014 just you, a pegboard, and the one move that makes the shape appear."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/Meshy-SC/FlexVision/blob/main/PRIVACY_POLICY_MH.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Meshy", "support_website_url": "https://github.com/Meshy-SC/FlexVision/blob/main/SUPPORT_MH.md", "website_url": "https://github.com/Meshy-SC/FlexVision", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interactio